  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Steam Engine** (1 review): Steam Engine was highlighted as the top hit of the night [6]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **November 2021 (Thursday)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [7]\n- **At Dawn**: back after 27 archived shows (1343 days) [7]\n- **Where To Begin**: back after 61 archived shows (2210 days) [7]\n- **Spinning My Wheels**: rare: 4 archived performances [7]\n- **Penny For Your Thoughts**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [7]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Least Expected [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2021-11-04.leary** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 140 min; rated 5/5 by 5 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording is described as having a great sound quality [5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bedouine opened the first of a three-night stand at the Auditorium Theatre [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2021-11-04.leary**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: Microtech Gefell M21 > nBob actives > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Transferred from MP6 to iMac, tracked in Sound Studio, and encoded via xACT [1]",
